event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":87,"item_id":"rs_00416c8b7813902c016aca245b292481948018a10aeed9a3cd","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering edits and scripts**\n\nI need to figure out how to reduce repetition in my edits, perhaps by generating them through a script. It seems that if I use a precise edit or signature, I can manage the priority filter and avoid any existing arguments. If I'm thinking about a single project page, rewriting around 60 lines of code might be undesirable but could improve the entire function. Maybe I should introduce a helper to handle these issues more efficiently."}

